    {
      "id": "1ff8ac7a-2f5e-4768-ac4a-4841a93b5eb4",
      "name": "Template overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -560,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 832,
        "content": "## Export bank transactions, invoices and attachments from QuickBooks Online to a ZIP file\n\nThis template exports a date range from QuickBooks Online into one ZIP file for your archive or your accountant.\n\n### How it works\n\n1. **Config** sets your company ID and the date range (last month by default).\n2. The bank ledger, bank transactions, invoices, client payments and expenses in that range are fetched.\n3. Files attached to bank transactions and the PDFs of sent or paid invoices are downloaded.\n4. Everything is packed into one ZIP: five CSV files, the invoice PDFs and the attachments, with `attachments_index.csv` mapping each file to its transaction.\n\n### Setup\n\n1. Create a **QuickBooks Online OAuth2** credential and select it on the QuickBooks nodes and the two *Query* HTTP Request nodes.\n2. In **Config**, replace `YOUR_COMPANY_ID` with your QuickBooks company ID (Settings \u2192 Account and settings \u2192 Billing & subscription).\n3. Click **Execute workflow** and download the ZIP from **Zip Export**.\n\n### Requirements\n\n- A QuickBooks Online company and an Intuit developer app for the OAuth2 credential.\n\n### Customization\n\n- Change `startDate` and `endDate` in **Config** to export a quarter or a full year.\n- For a sandbox company, set `apiBase` to `https://sandbox-quickbooks.api.intuit.com`.\n\n\nBuilt by\n[![Cloud Labs](https://low-code-consultant.com/brand/n8n-strip.png#full-width)](https://low-code-consultant.com)"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5d7ddb5b-29e2-4e50-b92d-8991831d1613",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        224,
        880
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cfg-realm",
              "name": "realmId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "YOUR_COMPANY_ID"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-base",
              "name": "apiBase",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "https://quickbooks.api.intuit.com"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-start",
              "name": "startDate",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $today.minus({ months: 1 }).startOf('month').toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd') }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-end",
              "name": "endDate",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $today.minus({ months: 1 }).endOf('month').toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd') }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-entities",
              "name": "bankEntities",
              "type": "array",
              "value": "={{ [\"Purchase\", \"Deposit\", \"Transfer\", \"BillPayment\", \"SalesReceipt\", \"Payment\"] }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
